what is git ? git is a tool to manage code versions in our local computer


in git hub there are many commands like 
git add .   =>it means adding a file // to tell git to start tracking this file in case of modification
git status  =>checking status like how many files are created/modified # correct but also 
git init    # it should be the first command to initialize git tool to your directory 
git push    => we can push the file to github
git pull   # to extract the latest updated code from cloud storage (github) to our local computer
